ionship in support of the green and  the digital transition of our economies  together we will also engage with our  international partners for shared  commitment and joint action  to reduce emissions by 2030 and to have  tangible goals to become climate neutral  economies  by 2050. and in this way  we hope and we work for achieving the  most ambitious  possible outcome at cop26 in glasgow  and at the biodiversity cup 15 in  kunming  honourable members this is the ambition  we want to bring to the table  when we meet with our partners and  friends from all over the world  i know that you the european parliament  share  this ambition because we all want to end  this pandemic  and we all want to leave a healthy  planet  to future generations long-lived europe  thank you

